  Finally set
  $ c_0 = a_n + sum_(i = 1)^n theta_i \( y_n \) . $
  All summands are orthogonal positive contractions in $"Her" \( u \)$.
    Their sum is a contraction, and in each representation its norm is the maximum of the summand norms.
    The preceding signals prove (6.13). For every $tau gt.eq 0$, orthogonal functional calculus and (2.7) give
